      "role": "user",
      "content": "the manufacturer? i dont think they'd help, they're the ones who make the hardware in the first place. it's just so creepy because it's so precise. like, if they can use the lights to pulse data out, could they also be using the sensors to listen to me? i feel like every time i have a private conversation in this room, the lights do this little micro-adjustment in brightness. it's like they're \"waking up\" to record. how would i even know if that was happening?",
